  "details": "So basically right now players need to always send custom event and pre-set the UI button actions from inspector.\n\nHowever it would be useful if people could do this inside a code.\n\nLike lets say you have 10 commands that give different int value.\n\nSo instead of the current method of making 10 void functions, action1(), action2() etc.\n\nYou could have action(int target);\n\nand in the code before you have your UI buttons chosen through an array and make them execute the action(int target) function with the ints of your choosing.",
